### Example: Repository

Self-contained via `RepositoryModule`. Interface at `Repository/` root; entity POCOs in `Repository/Domain/`.  
Canonical: `find_symbol("IWeatherRepository")`, `find_symbol("WeatherRepository")`

```csharp
// IWeatherRepository.cs — at Repository/ root
public interface IWeatherRepository
{
    Task<List<WeatherEntity>> GetWeatherAsync();
    Task SaveAsync(WeatherEntity entity);
}

// WeatherRepository.cs — implementation; entity models never leak to Services/Domain
public class WeatherRepository : IWeatherRepository
{
    public Task<List<WeatherEntity>> GetWeatherAsync()
    {
        // production: inject ISandboxDbExecutorFactory, call GetConnectionAsync(), use Dapper
        var now = DateTime.UtcNow;
        return Task.FromResult(new List<WeatherEntity>
        {
            new() { StartTime = now.AddHours(-1), EndTime = now, TemperatureC = 20, Condition = "Cloudy" },
        });
    }

    public Task SaveAsync(WeatherEntity entity)
    {
        // production: inject ISandboxDbExecutorFactory, Dapper Execute with @params
        return Task.CompletedTask;
    }
}
```

