### Example: Frontend unit test — Jest + React Testing Library

Before writing any test: `get_file_context` on `src/frontend/src/tests/` for the `Root` wrapper.  
Mirror source under `src/tests/` — `.test.tsx` for JSX, `.test.ts` for pure logic.

```tsx
import React from 'react';
import { act, render, screen } from '@testing-library/react';
import Root from '@root/tests/Root';
import WeatherPage from '@root/pages/weather';

describe('WeatherPage', () => {
  it('renders page header without crashing', async () => {
