```

**Rules:**
- Always `await act(async () => { render(<Root>...</Root>); })`. `Root` composes the full provider stack + `MemoryRouter`.
- `describe` per component/page; `it` describes the behaviour.
- `// arrange` / `// act` / `// assert` — all three in order. Arrange and act may be combined for simple render tests.
- One assertion focus per test.
- E2E (Cypress) covers user-facing flows — do not duplicate at the Jest layer.

